# Attribution

## This project

Unofficial community-built container images for ISC Kea DHCP.

**These images are not published by, affiliated with, or endorsed by
Internet Systems Consortium.** ISC publishes its own official Kea images; see
<https://cloudsmith.io/~isc/repos/docker/packages/>. For help with these
images, please use this repository's issue tracker rather than contacting
ISC.

The name "Kea" and "ISC" are used solely to identify the upstream software
these images contain.

